{"sections":{"hero_custom":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"Hero","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","custom_liquid":"<style>\n.eh{position:relative;width:100%;height:74vh;min-height:440px;max-height:720px;overflow:hidden;background:#0C4A56;}\n.eh-sl{position:absolute;inset:0;}\n.eh-sl img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0;animation:ehFade 21s infinite;}\n.eh-sl img:nth-child(1){animation-delay:0s;}\n.eh-sl img:nth-child(2){animation-delay:7s;}\n.eh-sl img:nth-child(3){animation-delay:14s;}\n@keyframes ehFade{0%{opacity:0;}5%{opacity:1;}28%{opacity:1;}34%{opacity:0;}100%{opacity:0;}}\n.eh::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,74,86,.30) 0%,rgba(11,42,49,.78) 100%);}\n.eh-in{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;padding:0 clamp(20px,6vw,88px);max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;}\n.eh-kick{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DFEFF1;margin:0 0 14px;}\n.eh-in h1{font-size:clamp(31px,5.4vw,58px);color:#FCFAF7;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.04;font-weight:800;max-width:15ch;}\n.eh-in p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.9vw,20px);color:#DFEFF1;margin:0 0 30px;max-width:46ch;line-height:1.5;}\n.eh-cta{display:inline-block;background:#00C2A8;color:#0B2A31;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;padding:17px 38px;border-radius:0;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:transform .14s ease-out,filter .14s ease-out;}\n.eh-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.06);transform:translateY(-2px);}\n.eh-cta:active{transform:translateY(0);}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.eh-sl img{animation:none;opacity:1;}.eh-sl img:not(:first-child){display:none;}.eh-cta{transition:none;}}\n@media(max-width:640px){.eh{height:66vh;}.eh-in{align-items:stretch;}.eh-cta{text-align:center;}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"eh\">\n<div class=\"eh-sl\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0843/2372/9628/files/photo1.jpg\" alt=\"Ouvre-huîtres Estran\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0843/2372/9628/files/photo_3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0843/2372/9628/files/photo_5.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"eh-in\">\n<p class=\"eh-kick\">ESTRAN — OUVRE-HUÎTRES</p>\n<h1>La douzaine, sans lutter</h1>\n<p>Le couteau de cuisine n'est pas fait pour ça. Il ripe, et c'est la main qui encaisse.</p>\n<a class=\"eh-cta\" href=\"/products/estran-ouvre-huitres\">Voir l'ouvre-huîtres</a>\n</div>\n</div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"ticker_promo":{"type":"horizontal-ticker","blocks":{"tick_1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Livraison suivie"}},"tick_2":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Retours sous 14 jours"}},"tick_3":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Paiement sécurisé"}},"tick_4":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Une seule référence, choisie"}}},"block_order":["tick_1","tick_2","tick_3","tick_4"],"settings":{"visibility":"always-display","speed":3,"direction":"normal","stop_on_hover":false,"mobile_spacing":50,"desktop_spacing":90,"color_scheme":"accent-1","mobile_text_size":15,"desktop_text_size":16,"italic_text":false,"uppercase_text":false,"bold_text":true,"mobile_image_height":26,"desktop_image_height":40,"mobile_reviews_width":300,"desktop_reviews_width":400,"hidden_products":"","enable_specific_display":false,"displayed_products":"","mobile_padding_top":12,"mobile_padding_bottom":12,"desktop_padding_top":16,"desktop_padding_bottom":16,"custom_colors_background":"#0C4A56","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#ffffff"}},"pourquoi":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"Pourquoi","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","custom_liquid":"<style>\n.ep{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}\n.ep h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:#0B2A31;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.1;}\n.ep .s{color:#4A666F;margin:0 0 34px;font-size:17px;max-width:56ch;line-height:1.55;}\n.ep-g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(11,42,49,.12);border-top:1px solid rgba(11,42,49,.12);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,42,49,.12);}\n.ep-c{background:#FCFAF7;padding:26px 22px;}\n.ep-n{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#4A666F;display:block;margin-bottom:12px;}\n.ep-c h3{font-size:19px;color:#0B2A31;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.25;}\n.ep-c p{font-size:16.5px;color:#4A666F;margin:0;line-height:1.65;}\n@media(max-width:860px){.ep-g{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ep\">\n<h2>Pourquoi ça dérape avec un couteau de cuisine</h2>\n<p class=\"s\">Ouvrir une huître n'est pas une question de force. C'est une question d'angle et d'outil.</p>\n<div class=\"ep-g\">\n<div class=\"ep-c\"><span class=\"ep-n\">01</span><h3>La lame est trop longue</h3><p>Elle fait levier au mauvais endroit. L'effort part vers le côté au lieu d'entrer dans la charnière.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ep-c\"><span class=\"ep-n\">02</span><h3>Elle est trop souple</h3><p>Une lame de cuisine plie sous la pression. Elle glisse au moment où la coquille cède.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ep-c\"><span class=\"ep-n\">03</span><h3>Alors on force</h3><p>Et c'est le geste qui blesse. La main gauche est juste derrière la lame, protégée par un torchon.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":56,"padding_bottom":56}},"produit_home":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"Le produit","title_highlight_color":"#00808A","heading_size":"h1","description":"","show_description":false,"description_style":"body","color_scheme":"background-2","collection":"meilleures-ventes","products_to_show":4,"stretch_cards":false,"show_view_all":false,"view_all_style":"solid","cards_color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"square","show_secondary_image":false,"badges":"regular","show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"enable_quick_add":false,"swatches_option_name":"","swatches_position":"top","swatches_desktop_size":36,"swatches_mobile_size":24,"type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":false,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":false,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","columns_mobile":"1","slider_mobile":false,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":false,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"under","padding_top":56,"padding_bottom":56,"custom_colors_background":"#DFEFF1","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#0B2A31","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#0C4A56","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff"}},"geste":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"Le geste","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","custom_liquid":"<style>\n.eg{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}\n.eg h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:#0B2A31;margin:0 0 26px;line-height:1.1;}\n.eg ol{list-style:none;counter-reset:g;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:1px;background:rgba(11,42,49,.12);}\n.eg li{counter-increment:g;background:#F7F1E8;padding:20px 22px 20px 62px;position:relative;font-size:16px;color:#0B2A31;line-height:1.6;}\n.eg li::before{content:counter(g,decimal-leading-zero);position:absolute;left:22px;top:20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#4A666F;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"eg\">\n<h2>Le geste, en cinq temps</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Pose l'huître à plat dans un torchon plié, côté creux en dessous.</li>\n<li>Repère la charnière, à la pointe. C'est le seul point d'entrée.</li>\n<li>Entre par la charnière, jamais par le côté. Appui court, puis tourne.</li>\n<li>Passe la lame sous le muscle pour détacher la chair.</li>\n<li>Rince à l'eau claire et sèche tout de suite. Le sel n'attend pas.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":56,"padding_bottom":56}},"reassurance":{"type":"icon-bar","blocks":{"col1":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"local_shipping","filled_icon":true,"title":"Livraison suivie","text":"<p>Numéro de suivi communiqué dès l'expédition</p>"}},"col2":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"shield","filled_icon":true,"title":"Retours 14 jours","text":"<p>Droit de rétractation, sans justification</p>"}},"col3":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"lock","filled_icon":true,"title":"Paiement sécurisé","text":"<p>Transactions chiffrées de bout en bout</p>"}},"col4":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"chat","filled_icon":true,"title":"Réponse sous 48 h","text":"<p>Une question avant d'acheter, écris-nous</p>"}}},"block_order":["col1","col2","col3","col4"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"","title_highlight_color":"#00808A","heading_size":"h2","text":"","color_scheme":"accent-1","icon_layout":"vertical","icon_size":"medium","icon_color":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"accent-1","type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":4,"slider_desktop":false,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":false,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","columns_mobile":"2","slider_mobile":false,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":false,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"under","padding_top":48,"padding_bottom":48,"custom_colors_background":"#0C4A56","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#ffffff","custom_cards_colors_background":"#0C4A56","custom_cards_gradient_background":"","custom_cards_colors_text":"#ffffff"}},"faq_home":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"FAQ","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","custom_liquid":"<style>\n.ef{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}\n.ef h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:#0B2A31;margin:0 0 26px;line-height:1.1;}\n.ef details{border-top:1px solid rgba(11,42,49,.14);}\n.ef details:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,42,49,.14);}\n.ef summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 40px 18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#0B2A31;position:relative;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;}\n.ef summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}\n.ef summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:6px;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;color:#00808A;}\n.ef details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\";}\n.ef .a{padding:0 0 20px;color:#4A666F;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ef\">\n<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2>\n<details><summary>Faut-il de la force ?</summary><div class=\"a\">Non, et c'est justement le point. La force est ce qui fait déraper la lame. Le geste juste, c'est un appui court dans la charnière, puis une rotation.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Ça marche sur toutes les huîtres ?</summary><div class=\"a\">Les creuses de calibre 2 et 3 sont les plus faciles. Les plates demandent plus de doigté, quel que soit l'outil.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Je n'ai jamais ouvert d'huîtres, c'est pour moi ?</summary><div class=\"a\">Oui. Le mode d'emploi ci-dessus est le geste complet. La difficulté n'est pas la technique, c'est de partir avec le mauvais outil.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Et si je change d'avis ?</summary><div class=\"a\">Tu as 14 jours après réception pour nous le renvoyer, sans avoir à te justifier. C'est la loi, on ne fait pas semblant que ce soit un cadeau.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Le paiement est-il sécurisé ?</summary><div class=\"a\">Oui, les transactions passent par une connexion chiffrée. Les moyens de paiement acceptés sont affichés en bas de page.</div></details>\n</div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":56,"padding_bottom":48}},"contact_form_WHP8G7":{"type":"contact-form","blocks":{"field_row_fNxBGi":{"type":"field_row","settings":{"input_1_enabled":true,"input_1_type":"name","input_1_required":true,"input_1_error_message":"Ce champ est obligatoire","input_1_custom_name":"Nom","input_2_enabled":true,"input_2_type":"email","input_2_required":true,"input_2_error_message":"Ce champ est obligatoire","input_2_custom_name":"Email"}},"textarea_NbxXax":{"type":"textarea","settings":{"input_type":"comment","input_required":true,"input_error_message":"Ce champ est obligatoire","input_custom_name":"Message"}}},"block_order":["field_row_fNxBGi","textarea_NbxXax"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"Une question ?","title_highlight_color":"#00808A","heading_size":"h2","button_full_width":true,"color_scheme":"background-2","success_icon":"check_circle","success_icon_filled":false,"success_text_color":"#0C4A56","success_bg_color":"#DFEFF1","success_border_radius":0,"success_border_width":1,"success_border_color":"#0C4A56","errors_icon":"error","errors_icon_filled":false,"errors_text_color":"#B3261E","errors_bg_color":"#F7F1E8","errors_border_radius":0,"errors_border_width":1,"errors_border_color":"#B3261E","padding_top":48,"padding_bottom":56,"custom_colors_background":"#F7F1E8","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#0B2A31","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#0C4A56","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff"}}},"order":["hero_custom","ticker_promo","pourquoi","produit_home","geste","reassurance","faq_home","contact_form_WHP8G7"]}